    "Id": "chassisdef_rikki_tikki_tavi_RTT-5",
    "Name": "Rikki Tikki Tavi",
    "Details": "The Rikki Tikki Tavi 5 is an experimental variant, trying to introduce artillery as part of the line-up with its arm mounted Sniper Artillery. The rest of the loadout is also greatly changed, only the original Gauss Rifle remains, now accompanied by three Extended Range Medium Lasers and one Extended Range PPC.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Distracting</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.24</color></b>",
